# Changelog

## [0.3.1.17]

### Changed
- Result CSV is now `<target_dir>/result__{target}__{project_code}__{workdir}.csv`, so results of different projects / workdirs of the same target no longer mix (#59). `avica pipe result` gains `--project` and `--workdir`; with several matches it lists them and shows the newest. Old `{target}_result.csv` files are still read.
- All CASA logging of a pipeline run goes to one file, `casa.logs/casa__log-<stamp>.log`, next to `avica.logs/`, with a marker line before every CASA task; stderr and failed-task tracebacks go to `casa.logs/err-casa__log-<stamp>.log` (#58). Default-named `casa-*.log` / `ipython-*.log` created during the run are merged into it.

### Fixed
- Stray `from turtle import st` in `avica.pipe.core`, which broke the import on systems without tkinter.
- fringefit tasks run through the persistent CASA worker now log to the run's CASA log instead of CASA's default log.
- stray `\` causing crash in the ANTAB parser.

